'''Uesugi Kenshin''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. She was added in [[Version 3.2 Update|Version 3.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] increases movement speed, attack rate and health. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] increases health and range, decreases recharge time and gains the [[Mini-Wave]] ability. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

